1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,530
A father begs Jesus:

2
00:00:02,400 --> 00:00:03,990
my little girl is dying.

3
00:00:05,440 --> 00:00:07,130
On the road, the news comes:

4
00:00:07,760 --> 00:00:08,870
"Thy daughter is dead:

5
00:00:09,180 --> 00:00:11,150
why troublest thou the Master any further?"

6
00:00:12,280 --> 00:00:12,910
Too late.

7
00:00:13,420 --> 00:00:16,350
Jesus heard it, and did not turn back.

8
00:00:17,460 --> 00:00:18,570
"Be not afraid,

9
00:00:19,100 --> 00:00:19,900
only believe."

10
00:00:19,900 --> 00:00:22,420
He went into the room with her father and mother,

11
00:00:22,420 --> 00:00:24,110
and took her by the hand.

12
00:00:25,400 --> 00:00:26,590
"Talitha cumi."

13
00:00:27,020 --> 00:00:28,090
"Damsel,

14
00:00:28,680 --> 00:00:30,790
I say unto thee, arise."

15
00:00:31,820 --> 00:00:32,910
Little girl,

16
00:00:33,280 --> 00:00:33,790
get up.

17
00:00:34,140 --> 00:00:36,130
She got up and walked.

18
00:00:37,440 --> 00:00:39,170
The news had said it was over.

19
00:00:39,960 --> 00:00:41,880
Jesus had heard it, and gone on.

20
00:00:41,880 --> 00:00:44,830
If you hear that it is too late,

21
00:00:45,420 --> 00:00:46,810
hear Him instead:

22
00:00:47,440 --> 00:00:48,990
"Be not afraid,

23
00:00:49,500 --> 00:00:50,670
only believe."
